!
! QoS policing examples based on the source configuration pattern
! CIR values below are illustrative only and expressed in bits per second.
!
policy-map PM-100M-POLICE
 class class-default
  police cir 100000000
   conform-action transmit
   exceed-action drop
!
policy-map PM-300M-POLICE
 class class-default
  police cir 300000000
   conform-action transmit
   exceed-action drop
!
! Example service-policy attachment (confirm direction and platform support):
! interface TenGigabitEthernet0/0/24
!  service-policy input PM-100M-POLICE
!
! Do not attach a policer until the intended CIR, burst parameters,
! direction, service instance behavior and hardware scale are confirmed.
!
